WEBVTT

00:04.220 --> 00:07.320
Miss Claire! Good mor...

00:07.680 --> 00:08.200
...ning?

00:08.200 --> 00:09.970
Yeah, exactly.

00:11.640 --> 00:13.170
Oh, Sister...

00:14.980 --> 00:16.540
Hey, Rae. Good morning.

00:16.540 --> 00:18.710
G-Good morning.

00:18.710 --> 00:20.750
You've shown up too late.

00:21.100 --> 00:24.620
My dear Sister took care of 
all my preparations for me.

00:24.620 --> 00:26.770
And she was so good at it!

00:27.540 --> 00:30.760
I used to take care of Claire 
like this all the time.

00:30.760 --> 00:35.070
Princess Manaria, seeing to Miss Claire's 
day-to-day needs is my hob—

00:35.070 --> 00:36.660
Cough, cough.

00:36.660 --> 00:37.990
It's my job.

00:37.990 --> 00:40.630
I would appreciate it if you 
would refrain from doing this.

00:40.630 --> 00:43.910
I heard that! You were about 
to say something creepy!

00:43.910 --> 00:45.760
You don't need to worry, Rae.

00:45.760 --> 00:48.080
I'm just doing this because I want to.

00:48.390 --> 00:51.030
In fact, you should let me 
do this every day, Claire.

00:52.140 --> 00:54.370
Would it bother you to have me as your maid?

00:54.370 --> 00:57.170
Oh, Sister, you're teasing me.

00:57.460 --> 01:01.290
Sorry. You're just so cute, I can't resist.

01:01.700 --> 01:03.920
Now, come, my princess.

01:03.920 --> 01:06.650
Allow me to show you to the dining hall.

02:42.020 --> 02:47.020
<b>Episode 11</b>

02:42.020 --> 02:47.020
<b>A Near-Miss in Love Is Certain Doom</b>

03:05.500 --> 03:08.740
Are you all right, Rae? You look pale.

03:08.740 --> 03:11.100
I'm Miss Claire-deficient.

03:11.100 --> 03:13.480
Oh, okay. So all is normal.

03:13.480 --> 03:14.550
Goodnight.

03:15.380 --> 03:17.080
Hear me out, Misha!

03:17.080 --> 03:20.510
Thanks to Princess Manaria, 
I can't fawn over Miss Claire at all!

03:20.510 --> 03:22.430
She won't even bully me!

03:22.430 --> 03:23.180
"Ahh..."

03:23.180 --> 03:27.270
What was that all about?! I'm so jealous!

03:25.080 --> 03:27.270
You're more seriously ill than I thought.

03:27.670 --> 03:30.570
Did you do something to Princess Manaria?

03:31.120 --> 03:35.170
You know, maybe this is a good opportunity 
to wean yourself off of Miss Claire.

03:35.170 --> 03:35.900
I can't!

03:36.260 --> 03:38.590
Miss Claire is my reason for living!

03:38.590 --> 03:41.870
I can't even imagine my life 
without her in it!

03:41.870 --> 03:44.290
No Claire, no life!

03:44.290 --> 03:46.930
Then you'll just have to fight, won't you?

03:47.920 --> 03:51.920
But that just seems like giving 
Princess Manaria exactly what she wants.

03:51.920 --> 03:53.170
What do you mean?

03:53.170 --> 03:55.470
I feel like she's trying to provoke me.

03:55.800 --> 03:58.180
Then I guess you'll just 
have to put up with it.

03:58.180 --> 04:01.710
It's not as if you've been 
separated from Miss Claire.

04:05.100 --> 04:10.570
<i>Princess Manaria was supposed to be 
the heroine's ally in the game.</i>

04:10.570 --> 04:13.940
<i>So why is she taking Miss Claire's side?</i>

04:13.940 --> 04:16.570
<i>That's the part I don't get.</i>

04:18.350 --> 04:20.990
<i>Not that it matters, really.</i>

04:21.400 --> 04:24.240
<i>As long as Miss Claire is happy...</i>

04:25.490 --> 04:30.370
<i>Miss Claire had closed herself off after 
losing Lene, and now she's feeling better.</i>

04:30.370 --> 04:32.130
<i>And that's all thanks to her.</i>

04:32.860 --> 04:35.870
<i>So I'm grateful to Princess Manaria.</i>

04:37.700 --> 04:39.270
<i>I am.</i>

04:41.640 --> 04:43.430
What's wrong, Pepi?

04:56.900 --> 05:01.780
As always, a monster extermination is being 
planned for this year's Amour Ceremony.

05:01.780 --> 05:03.310
Monster extermination?

05:03.310 --> 05:07.540
Monsters gather in the forest, drawn 
to the magic stone in the Scales of Love.

05:07.540 --> 05:12.190
Just weak ones, but in great numbers. 
More than the military can handle alone.

05:12.190 --> 05:15.290
So all the students of this academy 
help to kill them.

05:15.290 --> 05:19.370
To ensure everyone's safety on the day of 
the event, we will act in groups of three.

05:19.370 --> 05:21.680
You should go ahead and form your teams now.

05:21.680 --> 05:24.160
Claire, you'll be on a team with me, right?

05:24.160 --> 05:28.160
Of course! It would be an honor 
to team up with you!

05:28.780 --> 05:31.140
I will accompany you, Miss Claire.

05:31.950 --> 05:35.400
It really feels like the ceremony's 
just around the corner now.

05:35.400 --> 05:39.760
By the way, how do they 
decide who wins the bride?

05:39.760 --> 05:43.280
Surely it's not whoever's 
offering is heavier, right?

05:43.280 --> 05:46.750
No, physical weight 
has nothing to do with it.

05:46.750 --> 05:51.290
The Scales of Love measure 
the weight of one's feelings.

05:51.700 --> 05:53.310
<i>Incidentally, in the game,</i>

05:53.310 --> 05:57.000
<i>the winner was determined by 
how difficult their offering was to obtain.</i>

05:58.720 --> 06:01.200
The weightiest offering one can give

06:01.200 --> 06:04.160
is said to be the Flowers 
of Flora from the legend.

06:04.160 --> 06:07.690
The flowers of light 
mentioned in <i>Poesie Amour</i>?

06:07.690 --> 06:09.030
They really exist?

06:09.370 --> 06:10.560
Y-Yes.

06:10.970 --> 06:14.170
Though they are extremely difficult to obtain.

06:15.560 --> 06:19.360
I can't believe it follows the legend 
even down to that detail.

06:19.360 --> 06:20.820
Amazing.

06:20.820 --> 06:25.500
Frankly, I'm not all 
that fond of <i>Poesie Amour</i>.

06:25.500 --> 06:27.320
Oh? Why not?

06:27.320 --> 06:31.960
I mean, couldn't the priestess have just 
made the choice in the first place?

06:31.960 --> 06:34.800
Yet she makes the men fight over her.

06:34.800 --> 06:36.710
She's an evil woman.

06:36.710 --> 06:38.710
That's not true.

06:39.030 --> 06:42.210
I think the priestess simply couldn't decide.

06:42.990 --> 06:46.100
If you genuinely fall 
madly in love with someone,

06:46.550 --> 06:52.100
I bet your own true feelings 
aren't so clear, even to you yourself.

06:53.930 --> 06:56.250
Is that really how it works?

06:56.250 --> 06:58.980
They do say love is blind, after all.

06:58.980 --> 07:01.380
But I don't think that's quite—

07:01.380 --> 07:04.740
Rae, could you pour me some more tea, please?

07:08.760 --> 07:11.730
I'm sorry. I'll go make more.

07:11.730 --> 07:13.170
Please do.

07:13.170 --> 07:14.870
Oh, and take your time.

07:15.230 --> 07:18.130
No, no! I'll be right back!

07:22.130 --> 07:23.830
U-Um...

07:23.830 --> 07:25.870
We'll be going now, too.

07:28.550 --> 07:29.880
How strange.

07:29.880 --> 07:32.260
What? Pepi and Loretta?

07:32.260 --> 07:34.890
No, the commoner.

07:34.890 --> 07:37.270
She's been acting strange as of late.

07:37.270 --> 07:41.310
Oh? You watch Rae pretty closely, don't you?

07:41.310 --> 07:42.850
Well, I mean...

07:42.850 --> 07:45.670
That's just my job as her master.

07:47.230 --> 07:50.950
And yet you don't know 
why she's acting that way, huh?

07:50.950 --> 07:52.620
"Love is blind"...

07:53.390 --> 07:54.710
How true.

07:55.680 --> 07:57.080
Sister?

07:59.290 --> 08:01.300
It's nothing at all.

08:10.420 --> 08:11.720
Hey! You!

08:11.720 --> 08:15.520
Oh, you're the flunkies... 
Uh... What were your names?

08:15.520 --> 08:19.150
Really! You are just the most 
insolent commoner there could be!

08:19.150 --> 08:23.230
I'm very sorry, but I'm only 
interested in Miss Claire.

08:23.230 --> 08:24.980
So what did you need from me?

08:24.980 --> 08:28.690
Frankly, I can't comprehend 
the things you do at all!

08:28.960 --> 08:29.860
But...

08:30.300 --> 08:33.990
Your feelings for Miss Claire 
are not a lie, right?

08:33.990 --> 08:35.140
Right?!

08:35.140 --> 08:35.900
Huh?

08:35.900 --> 08:39.460
Look, no matter what happens, 
you must protect Miss Claire!

08:39.460 --> 08:43.370
You're her maid, so you can stay near her 
from morning to night, right?

08:43.370 --> 08:45.670
Even if it's royalty you're up against...

08:45.670 --> 08:46.760
Royalty?

08:46.760 --> 08:49.190
Are you talking about Princess Manaria?

08:49.190 --> 08:51.400
Hey! Not so loud!

08:51.400 --> 08:53.890
I see. You're not denying it.

08:55.000 --> 08:58.390
We heard Princess Manaria has, well...

08:58.390 --> 09:01.480
a reputation among the ladies 
of the night in the Sousse Kingdom.

09:01.480 --> 09:04.410
It's just a rumor! Yeah! Just a rumor!

09:06.110 --> 09:10.140
A-Anyway, if anything happens 
to Miss Claire, you'll regret it!

09:12.760 --> 09:17.960
Loretta, maybe we asked 
the wrong person for help.

09:17.960 --> 09:21.120
Please don't say that, Pepi.

09:24.280 --> 09:27.020
Well, goodnight, Miss Claire.

09:28.220 --> 09:30.400
You're so patient, Rae.

09:32.280 --> 09:33.850
Got a moment?

09:37.270 --> 09:39.770
You love Miss Claire, don't you?

09:40.160 --> 09:43.330
Yet you've been awfully well-behaved lately.

09:43.330 --> 09:45.400
Even after all my provocations.

09:45.940 --> 09:49.290
So you <i>were</i> provoking me.

09:49.290 --> 09:51.370
I do love Miss Claire,

09:51.370 --> 09:55.100
but I don't mind if she won't look my way.

09:55.100 --> 09:57.780
All I care about is that she's happy.

10:00.750 --> 10:04.930
Really? So that's all there is 
to your feelings, then?

10:04.930 --> 10:06.530
What a letdown.

10:06.530 --> 10:10.250
Pardon me? What do you mean, 
"that's all there is" to them?

10:10.250 --> 10:11.420
Nothing, really.

10:11.420 --> 10:14.010
Oh, did I hit a nerve? Sorry about that.

10:14.010 --> 10:18.890
With all due respect, my feelings 
for Miss Claire are second to none.

10:18.890 --> 10:20.860
Even though you've given up?

10:20.860 --> 10:22.730
I haven't given up!

10:23.110 --> 10:25.380
I'm putting Miss Claire's happiness first!

10:25.380 --> 10:27.030
You're just running away.

10:27.820 --> 10:32.270
Why don't you say you're the one 
who can make her the happiest?

10:32.270 --> 10:33.450
Well...

10:33.860 --> 10:38.310
<i>I'm prepared to do anything 
if it would make Miss Claire happy.</i>

10:38.600 --> 10:39.410
<i>But...</i>

10:40.300 --> 10:43.770
<i>I'm a commoner, and we're both girls.</i>

10:44.100 --> 10:46.670
<i>If the goal is to make Miss Claire happy,</i>

10:46.670 --> 10:49.420
<i>I'm not the right life partner for her.</i>

10:51.840 --> 10:53.240
Don't run away.

10:53.240 --> 10:54.630
I'm not running away.

10:54.630 --> 10:57.600
Then try and take her from me.

10:57.990 --> 10:59.780
Are you trying to pick a fight?

10:59.780 --> 11:03.480
Yep. You just figured that out?

11:04.020 --> 11:08.420
I'll cut you free of those 
half-baked feelings you have.

11:08.420 --> 11:11.870
The way you are now, 
I feel bad for both you and Claire.

11:12.980 --> 11:16.650
Very well, If you want 
a fight, you've got one.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.700
That's what I want to hear.

11:20.120 --> 11:23.610
Meet me at the magic practice ground 
after school tomorrow, then.

11:28.410 --> 11:29.770
And don't run away.

11:35.920 --> 11:37.780
<i>What's her deal?</i>

11:38.330 --> 11:39.860
<i>Fine, then!</i>

11:41.710 --> 11:43.030
Princess Manaria!

11:43.030 --> 11:45.150
She's going up against Rae Taylor this time?

11:45.150 --> 11:45.850
Should be good!

11:45.850 --> 11:47.600
Who do you think is gonna win?

11:48.030 --> 11:51.860
Um... Do you really have to do this, Sister?

11:51.860 --> 11:53.860
It's just a test of skill.

11:53.860 --> 11:55.860
Are you good to go, Rae?

11:55.860 --> 11:57.710
I could ask you the same thing.

11:58.330 --> 11:59.740
Amusing.

11:59.740 --> 12:01.070
That's the spirit.

12:02.370 --> 12:04.330
Are you both ready?

12:04.830 --> 12:05.850
Yep.

12:04.830 --> 12:05.850
Yes.

12:05.850 --> 12:07.710
In that case... Ready...

12:08.070 --> 12:09.050
Begin!

12:09.830 --> 12:11.750
Well? What's your move?

12:14.700 --> 12:17.960
The pitfall that won her 
the match against Claire last time.

12:17.960 --> 12:20.720
It's a somewhat effective strategy, but...

12:25.900 --> 12:27.680
Whew, that took me by surprise.

12:27.680 --> 12:30.600
But it'll take more than that to defeat me.

12:30.600 --> 12:33.210
I know. I was after something else.

12:37.250 --> 12:38.870
Water Meteor!

12:42.910 --> 12:43.960
Sister?!

12:43.960 --> 12:46.040
A fusion of earth and water magic?!

12:46.040 --> 12:47.880
That's some insane power.

12:47.880 --> 12:49.920
Even Manaria can't do much about that.

12:50.380 --> 12:51.920
No, look.

12:51.920 --> 12:53.790
Aw, man.

12:54.780 --> 12:56.780
I got a little damp.

13:00.170 --> 13:03.650
<i>The exceptional-level wind spell, Teleport...</i>

13:04.490 --> 13:08.810
Based on that reaction, it looks 
like Rae knew that was coming.

13:08.810 --> 13:10.580
But it's still a tough spell to deal with.

13:10.580 --> 13:14.980
This had better not mean she was 
holding back against me.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.480
You're going all-in right 
from the start, Rae.

13:17.480 --> 13:21.490
I can't defeat you if I don't.

13:22.220 --> 13:24.780
<i>Princess Manaria has Spell Breaker.</i>

13:25.540 --> 13:29.040
<i>If the battle drags out, 
she'll analyze all my spells</i>

13:29.040 --> 13:30.640
<i>and erase them.</i>

13:30.640 --> 13:32.040
<i>So before that happens...</i>

13:32.290 --> 13:35.450
You're not going to tell me 
you're done already, are you?

13:35.450 --> 13:37.450
No, of course not!

13:49.820 --> 13:55.110
<i>This is a high-level spell that you normally 
can't use until the end of the game...</i>

13:55.110 --> 13:57.340
<i>Chain Spell: Cocytus.</i>

13:58.820 --> 14:01.150
<i>The highest level of attack I have right now.</i>

14:01.670 --> 14:02.810
<i>This should...</i>

14:05.090 --> 14:07.660
Ah, so close.

14:13.260 --> 14:15.340
If it wasn't me you were up against,

14:15.340 --> 14:17.250
that probably would've been the end of it.

14:18.050 --> 14:20.260
How did you evade that?

14:21.500 --> 14:23.630
That's a secret.

14:23.630 --> 14:26.920
Teleport? No, not in that 
brief instant, right?

14:26.920 --> 14:29.640
She has the reaction speed of a monster, too?

14:29.640 --> 14:33.380
Anyway, Rae, don't you think 
you're going a bit too hard?

14:34.060 --> 14:37.510
Even if we are under 
a magic-dampening barrier,

14:37.510 --> 14:41.550
if that had hit me directly, 
I would've been more than just injured.

14:41.550 --> 14:44.070
Except you evaded it with no problem.

14:44.450 --> 14:47.220
Well, that's because I'm me.

14:48.430 --> 14:50.800
Since you gave me such an entertaining show,

14:50.800 --> 14:52.580
maybe I'll get a little more serious.

14:53.210 --> 14:55.080
<i>Oh, no! I know what's coming now!</i>

14:55.470 --> 14:57.460
<i>If I use Cocytus again...</i>

14:57.990 --> 14:59.520
<i>No, that won't work!</i>

15:00.090 --> 15:02.460
<i>But I don't have any other...</i>

15:03.340 --> 15:04.970
Let's end this!

15:11.950 --> 15:13.480
Dominator.

15:27.330 --> 15:29.670
<i>A spell fusing all four attributes:</i>

15:29.670 --> 15:31.090
<i>Dominator.</i>

15:31.090 --> 15:33.450
<i>It takes control of all magic 
within a given range</i>

15:33.950 --> 15:35.830
<i>and makes it go berserk.</i>

15:35.830 --> 15:38.120
<i>It's the strongest and most 
wicked attack spell there is...</i>

15:38.980 --> 15:42.630
<i>and the ultimate anti-magic weapon.</i>

16:06.320 --> 16:07.290
Commoner!

16:08.350 --> 16:09.790
Keep it together!

16:10.390 --> 16:11.620
Commoner, you...

16:12.580 --> 16:13.800
Hey...

16:13.800 --> 16:15.110
Commoner!

16:15.110 --> 16:17.120
Damn it, commoner!

16:17.120 --> 16:18.750
Commoner! Come on!

16:24.640 --> 16:26.940
Move, Claire. I'll heal her.

16:28.560 --> 16:29.880
Sister...

16:33.390 --> 16:36.300
She'll be fine now. You don't need to worry.

16:36.300 --> 16:38.140
You went too far, Sister!

16:38.450 --> 16:43.420
Your regular magic and Spell Breaker 
should have been enough!

16:43.420 --> 16:47.200
What would you have done 
if the worst had happened?!

16:47.200 --> 16:48.930
There's a barrier.

16:48.930 --> 16:52.030
Even Dominator couldn't 
have done lethal damage.

16:52.030 --> 16:54.870
Though I admit that it was 
more powerful than I thought

16:54.870 --> 16:58.470
because Rae's own magical power 
is so immense.

16:58.470 --> 17:00.300
How can you say that so calmly?

17:07.820 --> 17:11.120
You really worry about her a lot, don't you?

17:16.600 --> 17:18.740
Miss... Claire...

17:22.200 --> 17:23.370
Thank goodness...

17:23.810 --> 17:25.660
Did... I...

17:26.110 --> 17:27.950
You lost.

17:31.650 --> 17:34.930
<i>I see. I lost.</i>

17:36.180 --> 17:39.870
<i>I knew that Princess Manaria 
could use Dominator.</i>

17:40.330 --> 17:44.830
<i>That's right. I know... everything.</i>

17:45.710 --> 17:47.310
<i>Which is how I know...</i>

17:48.370 --> 17:52.470
So now we can say 
that Claire is mine, correct?

17:55.340 --> 17:56.550
<i>I...</i>

17:57.710 --> 17:59.820
<i>can't beat her.</i>

19:47.250 --> 19:50.420
Well done! You're going all-out, Rae!

19:50.420 --> 19:52.650
Don't you think you're being too reckless?

19:52.650 --> 19:55.300
You're still recovering, remember? You—

20:04.380 --> 20:06.230
Hey! Are you listening?!

20:07.060 --> 20:09.130
Let her be. Okay?

20:09.130 --> 20:12.780
But we formed teams for everyone's safety.

20:12.780 --> 20:13.860
And now...

20:14.340 --> 20:17.580
Rae is strong. She'll be fine on her own.

20:17.990 --> 20:20.550
It'll be all right. I guarantee it.

20:34.240 --> 20:37.090
Why would you leave your master's side?!

20:37.090 --> 20:38.510
Miss Claire...

20:38.510 --> 20:41.530
You're my maid, aren't you?

20:41.530 --> 20:45.830
And for you to be acting on your own 
after you were so badly hurt...

20:45.830 --> 20:47.520
This couldn't be more dangerous!

20:48.890 --> 20:52.950
What's the problem? 
You have Princess Manaria.

20:52.950 --> 20:55.660
The one and only quad-caster in the world.

20:55.660 --> 20:58.570
She should be more than 
enough to protect you.

20:58.570 --> 21:01.160
That's not what I'm talking about!

21:01.760 --> 21:03.570
You've been acting strange.

21:03.570 --> 21:05.870
Especially since your duel with Sister.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.360
Nothing's strange about me.

21:08.360 --> 21:09.410
Don't lie!

21:10.160 --> 21:13.240
Ralaire is too scared to even go near you!

21:13.920 --> 21:17.170
And worst of all, you haven't 
been acting like yourself.

21:22.010 --> 21:26.430
We fought that duel over you, Miss Claire.

21:26.810 --> 21:28.060
What?

21:28.710 --> 21:35.210
Which means I don't have the right 
to stay by your side anymore.

21:35.210 --> 21:37.190
How can you just...

21:37.190 --> 21:39.130
You were fighting over me?

21:39.620 --> 21:43.260
I am not some prize! 
What were you thinking?!

21:43.260 --> 21:45.330
Oh, really?

21:45.780 --> 21:48.570
I bet that actually makes 
you feel good, doesn't it?

21:48.570 --> 21:51.850
To be desired by someone 
as amazing as Princess Manaria...

21:53.050 --> 21:55.340
She was your prince and first love, right?

21:56.700 --> 21:58.450
Take that back.

21:58.450 --> 22:01.340
How dare you say such a thing 
to your master?!

22:02.050 --> 22:05.260
You're sulking like a child, 
losing your nerve because you lost,

22:05.260 --> 22:07.050
and just running from everything!

22:07.050 --> 22:10.210
Unbelievable! Do you feel no shame?!

22:10.850 --> 22:14.090
Such a... Such a...

22:14.850 --> 22:19.070
The way you are now, 
you're not fit to serve as my maid!

22:22.200 --> 22:24.820
Then I quit.

22:25.250 --> 22:26.460
What did you say?

22:26.460 --> 22:28.780
I'm quitting my job as your maid.

22:30.080 --> 22:31.780
Are you serious?

22:36.100 --> 22:37.350
I see.

22:38.570 --> 22:40.100
Very well, then.

22:41.470 --> 22:45.770
I may have had my complaints, 
but you've served me well.

22:46.310 --> 22:49.910
As the daughter of the François household, 
I give you my thanks.

22:52.860 --> 22:54.640
Thank you, Miss Taylor.

23:00.400 --> 23:01.520
Miss Claire—

23:01.520 --> 23:02.990
Go on and leave now.

23:04.750 --> 23:08.040
I apologize for all of my selfish demands.

23:08.390 --> 23:12.050
I pray you find happiness 
in your future, Miss Taylor.

23:15.440 --> 23:17.710
<i>I've made a mistake.</i>

23:21.780 --> 23:23.330
I'll be going, then.

23:26.090 --> 23:30.750
<i>A fatal mistake that I can't take back.</i>

23:35.990 --> 23:40.210
So now you're leaving me alone, too?

23:44.450 --> 23:45.900
You're a liar.

23:59.420 --> 24:00.920
<b>Episode 12</b>

23:59.420 --> 24:00.920
<b>The Villainess and I Are in Love</b>
